  "localModels.managed.stopOnExit": { type: "boolean", description: "Stop the managed chat daemon when the last CLI session exits. `true` (default) — closing the terminal frees the RAM/VRAM the model was holding; a second live session keeps the daemon up (see `session-registry.ts`). `false` — keep the model warm between sessions; the operator stops it via `atomic-agent models stop`." },
